    [5279]={name="Harpy Skinner",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Serena Bloodfeather' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Serena Bloodfeather",lore="You did so well with the lieutenants and underlings that I'd like you to do one last thing for me. Serena Bloodfeather is the sister of a harpy named Bloodfeather who was slain by Rexxar quite a while ago."},
    [5314]={name="Boar Hunter's Cape",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Consumed by Hatred' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Consumed by Hatred",lore="Perhaps you know the pain of uncertainty, perhaps not. But know this: I stand here every day, from the sun's rising till its decline, scouring the horizon for more of those monsters."},
    [5319]={name="Bashing Pauldrons",quality=1,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Haren Swifthoof (rare elite) in The Loch.",zone="The Loch",npc="Haren Swifthoof"},
    [5327]={name="Greasy Tinker's Pants",quality=2,ilvl=18,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Escape' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Escape",lore="I suppose I'll learn as we go... Couldn't be too hard. Just some buttons here, and a lever or two... Well, are you ready to go?"},
    [5346]={name="Orcish Battle Bow",quality=2,ilvl=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5351]={name="Bounty Hunter's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hezrul Bloodmark'. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Hezrul Bloodmark",lore="Hezrul Bloodmark is the leader of the Kolkar centaurs in the Barrens. He is fierce, brutal and cunning. Defeating him would disrupt and fracture the Kolkars, greatly reducing their threat to us."},
    [5394]={name="Archery Training Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Balance of Nature' - pick it over the other choices. In Shadowglen.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="The Balance of Nature",lore="Greetings. I am Conservator Ilthalaine. My purpose in Shadowglen is to ensure that the balance of nature is maintained."},
    [5404]={name="Serpent's Shoulders",quality=3,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lady Anacondra in Wailing Caverns.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Lady Anacondra"},
    [5591]={name="Rain-spotted Cape",quality=1,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Enchanted Glade' - pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Enchanted Glade",lore="I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."},
    [5596]={name="Ashwood Bow",quality=1,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Crown of the Earth' - pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Crown of the Earth",lore="Without the blessings of Alexstrasza the Life-Binder and Nozdormu the Timeless, Teldrassil's growth has not been without flaw."},
    [5616]={name="Gutwrencher",quality=3,ilvl=47,reqLevel=42,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop - drops from 15 creature types around level 44-46. Also found on the auction house.",proc="Chance on hit: Wounds the target causing them to bleed for 80 damage over 30 sec."},
    [5617]={name="Vagabond Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bashal'Aran' - pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [5627]={name="Relic Blade",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Absent Minded Prospector' - pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil. While I traveled on the road to meet Whelgar, I was attacked by raptors and the relic was lost."},
